`,(0,n.jsx)(r.p,{children:'These interconnected materials reference each other—the onboarding guide mentions roles from the role descriptions document, templates use language from the handbook, and tracking systems align with defined roles. When you update one document, review related materials to maintain alignment. You can ask Claude to "update the training timeline in the onboarding guide to reflect the new 6-week schedule" when policies change.'}),`
